Interpretation guide:
  ΔP(up), ΔE[fwd], ΔTP%, ΔSL% : higher = better regime discrimination
  WSNR                        : weighted SNR; higher = stronger overall signal
  fold_σ                      : lower = more consistent across folds
  hr_cov                      : higher = more distributed across UTC hours
  day_cov                     : higher = strong signals on more days (vs cluster on rare days)
  top_p                       : lower = less concentrated on single pair
  wkend                       : lower = less weekend-gap-detector pathology

WINNER = effect-size HIGHER + temporal coverage WIDER + concentration LOWER.
